Text Size

To change the text size on this website you can use your web browser's settings. Most browsers include functionality to let you increase or decrease the text on a web page. For example, to increase text size using:

**Chrome**

In the menu to the right of the address bar, select and set Zoom level. Menu > Zoom > +

**Firefox**

In the View menu, select Zoom. View > Zoom > Zoom In

**Internet Explorer**

In the View menu, select Text Size. View > Text Size > Largest

**Safari**

In the View menu, select Zoom In. View > Zoom In

Macintosh Shortcut: Command+

